MUTANT (unchanged from every prior capture of this pair -- the
evaluator's own M3): `_evaluate_capabilities`'s own union-match loop in
resolve-project-context.py. A Capability now "matches" only if EVERY
affected component's own trigger evaluation is true, never if ANY is
(`matched` initialised True and cleared on the first false result,
instead of initialised False and set on the first true one). AC-006
fixes union semantics; this is the intersection reading of the same
loop.

